## 3. Database Registration
To integrate the THB contract address with your wallet application:
1. **SQL Seeding:** Run the SQL command in [add_thb_token_contract.sql](file:///c:/Users/KARTHICK%20MAYUR/OneDrive/Desktop/cryptowallet/database/schemas/add_thb_token_contract.sql) directly inside your Supabase Dashboard SQL editor.
2. **Javascript Seeding:** Run the Supabase seeder script locally:
   ```bash
   node scripts/seed_supabase.js
   ```
This links `THB` on Sepolia to `0x5DA1034636F90b1b2e62F917847502FA5796653f` with `6` decimals. The wallet application will dynamically fetch the balance and execute send/receive transactions using the existing ERC-20 module.
